# Vernatun profile

For this repository start with AGENTS.md, docs/WEB_TEAM_READINESS.md and docs/WEB_DEVELOPMENT_PLAN.md.
Static site uses HTML/Alpine/Tailwind; Campus uses React/Vite/TypeScript; API is Python.
Sputnik/Cortana/FinGrad and Flutter references in shared rules are historical templates, not this product's stack.
Keep existing role boundaries, data protection and Client acceptance rules.
For design/testing/a11y/LCP route to .agents/skills via AGENTS.md.
Read docs/WEB_QUALITY_PLAYBOOK.md for asset, SEO, preview and evidence procedures.
Brand palette and typography are product decisions: an external skill does not authorize replacing them.
No universal networkidle for realtime pages. Wait for the relevant UI/API readiness condition.
Do not invent MCP capabilities. .cursor/mcp.json was absent at audit; cards mentioning servers are not evidence they exist.
Tooling-only changes go to a branch/PR: current main push automatically deploys production.
